151 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 53 0 R/T(One of Indonesia\220s largest integrated poultry producers is PT Japfa Comfeed Indonesia Tbk \(JPFA\). JPFA has produced animal protein for Indonesia since 1971 and now runs an integrated chain from animal feed and breeding to commercial farms, processed food, aquaculture and trading. We believe the company is priced for the trough but will be paid through the cycle. We initiate coverage with a BUY and a target price of Rp 2,770, 23.1% above the 11 September 2026 close. The target blends a free-cash-flow DCF \(70%, Rp 3,011\) with a relative valuation on five listed poultry peers \(30%, Rp 2,220\). Our view rests on three theses: JPFA stays profitable through the trough, it is turning from a livebird seller into a food company, and the market still prices it for the old cycle.)/E(One of Indonesia\220s largest integrated poultry producers is PT Japfa Comfeed Indonesia Tbk \(JPFA\). JPFA has produced animal protein for Indonesia since 1971 and now runs an integrated chain from animal feed and breeding to commercial farms, processed food, aquaculture and trading. We believe the company is priced for the trough but will be paid through the cycle. We initiate coverage with a BUY and a target price of Rp 2,770, 23.1% above the 11 September 2026 close. The target blends a free-cash-flow DCF \(70%, Rp 3,011\) with a relative valuation on five listed poultry peers \(30%, Rp 2,220\). Our view rests on three theses: JPFA stays profitable through the trough, it is turning from a livebird seller into a food company, and the market still prices it for the old cycle.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[78]>>
endobj

