259 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 55 0 R/T(than 130 company farms and more than 8,700 contract farms \(Figure 2.3\), and raw-material buying is centralised through the wider Japfa Group. Downstream, it runs 15 slaughterhouses and three meat processing units, and in 2025 it built a second slaughterhouse at Pemalang, with cold storage \(JPFA, 2026a\). Upstream, it dries corn at 15 sites outside its feed mills, mostly in growing areas such as Lampung and Sumbawa.)/E(than 130 company farms and more than 8,700 contract farms \(Figure 2.3\), and raw-material buying is centralised through the wider Japfa Group. Downstream, it runs 15 slaughterhouses and three meat processing units, and in 2025 it built a second slaughterhouse at Pemalang, with cold storage \(JPFA, 2026a\). Upstream, it dries corn at 15 sites outside its feed mills, mostly in growing areas such as Lampung and Sumbawa.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[5]>>
