261 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 55 0 R/T(JPFA\220s 2025 annual report theme is \215Driving Sustainable Growth through Innovation and Efficiency\216. Its feed mills use near-infrared spectroscopy \(NIRS\) to check raw-material quality, and its farms run tighter biosecurity against disease. We expect both to improve efficiency and make biological asset growth more consistent. Its processing plants hold international certifications, so its products meet export-grade quality standards and can reach a wider market. Processing is also where new capital is going, with PPCP capex of Rp 459bn in 1H26 alone \(Figure 2.5\).)/E(JPFA\220s 2025 annual report theme is \215Driving Sustainable Growth through Innovation and Efficiency\216. Its feed mills use near-infrared spectroscopy \(NIRS\) to check raw-material quality, and its farms run tighter biosecurity against disease. We expect both to improve efficiency and make biological asset growth more consistent. Its processing plants hold international certifications, so its products meet export-grade quality standards and can reach a wider market. Processing is also where new capital is going, with PPCP capex of Rp 459bn in 1H26 alone \(Figure 2.5\).)/Pg 13 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

