<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 59 0 R/Pg 17 0 R/A[2978 0 R 0]/Alt(Net foreign-currency monetary liabilities fell from US$331m at 31 December 2025 to US$68m at 30 June 2026 after the US$350m notes were repaid)/K[94]>>
