675 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 59 0 R/E(Profit to owners was Rp 0.9tn to Rp 2.0tn a year in FY20\205FY23. It reached Rp 3.0tn in FY24 and Rp 4.0tn in FY25, and we forecast Rp 5.3tn in FY26F and Rp 4.4tn to Rp 5.0tn a year in FY27F\205FY30F \(Figure 5.5\). Our lowest forecast year, FY28F, is more than twice the old-cycle peak. Profit eases after FY26F, by 1.3% a year to FY30F, because segment margins revert while revenue keeps growing 9.7% a year \(Figure 5.8\). The share price still reflects the old level. We forecast earnings per share of Rp 449 in FY26F and Rp 379\205426 a year in FY27F\205FY30F, so at Rp 2,250 the stock trades at 5.0x FY26F earnings and 5.3\2055.9x after that \(Figure 5.6\). A 40% payout gives dividends of Rp 152\205180 a share, a yield of 6.7\2058.0%. That gap between earnings and price is Thesis 3.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[96]>>
endobj

