<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 62 0 R/E(Source : Sustainalytics via IDX and PitchBook, LSEG, MSCI via MarketScreener, S&P Global, Oct 2026. n.a. = no public rating)/Pg 20 0 R/K[2]>>
