2472 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 67 0 R/E(Sources, in order of preference: JPFA's own filings \(annual and sustainability reports, audited and interim financial statements\); government and agency data \(BPS, Bank Indonesia PIHPS and JISDOR, BGN decrees, Bapanas and Ministry of Trade regulations, USDA FAS GAIN\); and press reports of an official or association figure, used only where neither exists and named in the figure source. No brokerage research has been used, cited or paraphrased. Several inputs come from a JPFA Investor Relations session held over Zoom for all ERC 2026 participants in September 2026 \(information shared with every competing team, per the booklet's condition on management interviews\) and are cited as JPFA \(2026d\), or 'IR meeting' in figure sources: the feed formula \(about 50% corn, 22\20525% soybean meal\), raw materials at about 90% of cost of goods sold, 40% of own birds processed in-house by 2030, FY26 capex of about Rp 3tn, and management's 25\20530% processing growth plan \(cited, not modelled\). Peer data for CPIN and MAIN come from their own filings, and for the regional peers from their quarterly filings as compiled by Yahoo Finance. ESG ratings are from Morningstar Sustainalytics \(via IDX, PitchBook and Sustainalytics\), LSEG, MSCI \(via MarketScreener\) and S&P Global.)/Pg 25 0 R/K[97]>>
endobj

