3108 0 obj
<</Title(JPFA\220s 2025 annual report theme is \215Driving Sustainable Growth through Innovation and Efficiency\216. Its feed mills use near-infrared spectroscopy \(NIRS\) to check raw-material quality, and its farms run tighter biosecurity against disease. We expect both to improve efficiency and make biological asset growth more consistent. Its processing plants hold international certifications, so its products meet export-grade quality standards and can reach a wider market. Processing is also where new capital is going, with PPCP capex of Rp 459bn in 1H26 alone \(Figure 2.5\).)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2570 0 R>>
endobj

3109 0 obj
<</Title(Indonesia\220s economy grew 5.29% year on year in 2Q26, after 5.11% in 2025 \(Figure 3.1\). Household consumption grew 5.06% and government consumption 15.97% \(18.62% for 1H26\), driven mainly by civil-service pay and allowances, with Rp 44.7tn of meal-programme spending in the quarter \(Figure 3.2\). Both feed through to protein demand, and so to JPFA\220s volumes.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2571 0 R>>
endobj

3110 0 obj
