3210 0 obj
<</Title(than 130 company farms and more than 8,700 contract farms \(Figure 2.3\), and raw-material buying is centralised through the wider Japfa Group. Downstream, it runs 15 slaughterhouses and three meat processing units, and in 2025 it built a second slaughterhouse at Pemalang, with cold storage \(JPFA, 2026a\). Upstream, it dries corn at 15 sites outside its feed mills, mostly in growing areas such as Lampung and Sumbawa.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 3107 0 R>>
endobj

3211 0 obj
<</Title(Two market prices matter most for JPFA. The rupiah reaches costs through soybean meal, which is priced in dollars. JPFA\220s own balances imply Rp 16,782/US$ at 31 December 2025 and Rp 17,857 at 30 June 2026, 6.4% weaker \(JPFA, 2026b\), and JISDOR stood at 17,611 on 11 September \(Bank Indonesia, 2026b\). Rates set the discount rate. The 10-year government bond yield rose from 6.1% in December 2025 to 7.0\2057.3% since June 2026 \(Investing.com, 2026\).)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 3110 0 R>>
endobj

3212 0 obj
<</Title(Broiler supply is set largely by grandparent stock \(GPS\) imports, and changes in GPS show up in the DOC population about two years later \(USDA FAS, 2026a\). The national allocation rose from 530,000 birds in 2024 to 578,000 in 2025 and 800,000 in 2026, up 38% in a single year, and was split among 27 breeding companies against 24 before. JPFA kept 165,000 birds, while state-owned Berdikari\220s allocation rose five-fold \(Figure 3.3\). Our cohort model tracks each batch through two generations of rearing and laying. About 25% of a year\220s GPS reaches final-stock output the next year and 70% the year after, so the 2026 allocation lands as extra supply in 2027\20528 \(Figure 3.4, Annex 10\).)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 3111 0 R>>
endobj

